      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and accommodating grooming staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight stylists such as Shantel, Jalon, and Kuda for their patient demeanor and personal attention to detail. Many owners appreciate that groomers listen closely to styling preferences and soothe nervous pets. A few reviewers voiced dissatisfaction regarding scheduling arguments or customer service, but overall feedback is strongly positive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Consistent, neat breed-specific haircut results"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers praise the salon for neat breed styling, thorough de-skunking baths, and clean nail trims for both dogs and cats. Many clients report that pets return smelling fresh with soft, well-maintained coats that match their instructions. While one reviewer reported a grooming accident, the vast majority of owners express satisfaction with the finished cuts."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for sensitive companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents commend the salon for handling small breeds, senior dogs, and cats with gentleness and care. Owners of anxious Yorkies and Chihuahuas note that groomers take time to comfort animals throughout the bathing and haircut process. Reviewers feel reassured leaving their companion animals in a calm environment."
      }
    }
  ],
